{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["在那日，七個女人必拉住一個男人，說：「我們吃自己的食物，穿自己的衣服，但求你許我們歸你名下；求你除掉我們的羞恥。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的重建"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["到那日，耶和華發生的苗必華美尊榮，地的出產必為以色列逃脫的人顯為榮華茂盛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["主以公義的靈和焚燒的靈，將錫安女子的污穢洗去，又將耶路撒冷中殺人的血除淨。那時，剩在錫安、留在耶路撒冷的，就是一切住耶路撒冷、在生命冊上記名的，必稱為聖。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和華也必在錫安全山，並各會眾以上，使白日有煙雲，黑夜有火焰的光。因為在全榮耀之上必有遮蔽。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["必有亭子，白日可以得蔭避暑，也可以作為藏身之處，躲避狂風暴雨。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}